\item \code{"vue"}: a VUE or Fathom detection export with the VUE header.
\item \code{"vdat"}: a Fathom VDAT CSV (\verb{VEMCO DATA LOG}), from the receiver's VRL
or VDAT file. \code{DET} and \code{DET_SENS} records are read; a \code{DET} record that
